      "writtenOn": "2019-01-15T21:25:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Enabling UYVY itself is probably as easy as these lines, but this can create some more complications in determining external_camera_config.xml... The speed to decode MJPEG and the speed to decode UYVY to YU12 is different. Also UYVY buffers can take more USB bandwidth. These problems make setting up the minFrameDuration stuffs hard. This is why I didn\u0027t include UYVY support before.",
      "revId": "1a14dc9201f94dec4803dea7e142fe6a741a27c5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
