      "message": "There should be some checking on whether inData is Y16 and if its size is the same as output size.\n\nAlso since we can only get depth or color data out of V4L2, I think we need some proper check in configureStreams to check for the output streams are either all depth or all color.",
      "revId": "1a14dc9201f94dec4803dea7e142fe6a741a27c5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
